\item \code{bgcol}: If neither \code{vert_clrs} nor \code{vals} are used for coloring, \code{bgcol} is applied uniformly.
If \code{bgcol} is specified alongside \code{vert_clrs} or \code{vals}, the colors are blended based on the \code{alpha} parameter.
